{"source": "AI", "event_id": "6b71ec34-3bc1-4c38-bae6-56c5326f1893", "data_points": {"aiSharedDebtsDivision": "a. The Parties acknowledge that a complete identification of their community and separate debts and obligations remains pending the exchange of full financial disclosures. Accordingly, the Parties agree that each debt, once identified and characterized, shall be allocated between them in accordance with the principles set forth below.

b. Except as otherwise expressly provided herein, each Party shall assume, pay, and be solely responsible for any and all debts, liabilities, and obligations incurred in that Party's own name, and shall indemnify and hold the other Party harmless from any liability thereon. Husband shall be responsible for the debts and obligations held in his individual name, and Wife shall be responsible for the debts and obligations held in her individual name.

c. Any debts and obligations determined to be community in nature shall be divided equitably between the Parties upon completion of financial disclosure. The Parties recognize that Wife has historically maintained control over the shared bank and investment accounts; the Parties therefore agree to cooperate in good faith to identify all joint obligations and to memorialize their division by written amendment or supplemental agreement once the full extent of the community debt is ascertained."}, "data_schema_id": "66dec1950af2fa0007b0e36a", "data_points_count": 1}
